msgstr ""
":data:`sys.dont_write_bytecode` は、:c:member:`~PyConfig.write_bytecode` の値"
"を反転した値で初期化されます。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1333
msgid "Values of the :option:`-X` command line options: :data:`sys._xoptions`."
msgstr ""
":option:`-X` コマンドラインオプションの値。\n"
":data:`sys._xoptions` に対応します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1337
msgid ""
"If :c:member:`~PyConfig.parse_argv` is non-zero, :c:member:`~PyConfig.argv` "
"arguments are parsed the same way the regular Python parses :ref:`command "
"line arguments <using-on-cmdline>`, and Python arguments are stripped "
"from :c:member:`~PyConfig.argv`."
msgstr ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.parse_argv` がゼロ以外の場合、通常の Python が :ref:`コ"
"マンドライン引数 <using-on-cmdline>` を解析するのと同じよう"
"に :c:member:`~PyConfig.argv` の引数を解析し、Python 自体への引数"
"を :c:member:`~PyConfig.argv` から取り除きます。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1342
msgid ""
"The :c:member:`~PyConfig.xoptions` options are parsed to set other options: "
"see the :option:`-X` command line option."
msgstr ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.xoptions` のオプションを解析して、ほかのオプションを設定"
"します。\n"
":option:`-X` コマンドラインオプションを参照してください。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1347
msgid "The ``show_alloc_count`` field has been removed."
msgstr "``show_alloc_count`` フィールドが削除されました。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1353
msgid "Initialization with PyConfig"
msgstr "PyConfig による初期化"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1355
msgid ""
"Initializing the interpreter from a populated configuration struct is "
"handled by calling :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig`."
msgstr ""
"値を設定した構造体からインタープリタを初期化するに"
"は、:c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` を呼び出します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1361
msgid ""
"If :c:func:`PyImport_FrozenModules`, :c:func:`PyImport_AppendInittab` "
"or :c:func:`PyImport_ExtendInittab` are used, they must be set or called "
"after Python preinitialization and before the Python initialization. If "
"Python is initialized multiple times, :c:func:`PyImport_AppendInittab` "
"or :c:func:`PyImport_ExtendInittab` must be called before each Python "
"initialization."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyImport_FrozenModules`、:c:func:`PyImport_AppendInittab`、:c:func:`PyImport_ExtendInittab` "
"を使う場合は、Python の事前初期化の後、本初期化の前に設定または呼び出す必要が"
"あります。\n"
"Python を複数回初期化する場合は、初期化のたびに、その前"
"に :c:func:`PyImport_AppendInittab` または :c:func:`PyImport_ExtendInittab` "
"を呼び出さなければなりません。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1368
msgid ""
"The current configuration (``PyConfig`` type) is stored in "
"``PyInterpreterState.config``."
msgstr ""
"現在の設定 (``PyConfig`` 型) は、``PyInterpreterState.config`` に保存されま"
"す。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1371
msgid "Example setting the program name::"
msgstr "プログラム名を設定する例です。 ::"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1373
msgid ""
"void init_python(void)\n"
"{\n"
"    PyStatus status;\n"
"\n"
"    PyConfig config;\n"
"    PyConfig_InitPythonConfig(&config);\n"
"\n"
"    /* Set the program name. Implicitly preinitialize Python. */\n"
"    status = PyConfig_SetString(&config, &config.program_name,\n"
"                                L\"/path/to/my_program\");\n"
"    if (PyStatus_Exception(status)) {\n"
"        goto exception;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    status = Py_InitializeFromConfig(&config);\n"
"    if (PyStatus_Exception(status)) {\n"
"        goto exception;\n"
"    }\n"
"    PyConfig_Clear(&config);\n"
"    return;\n"
"\n"
"exception:\n"
"    PyConfig_Clear(&config);\n"
"    Py_ExitStatusException(status);\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"void init_python(void)\n"
"{\n"
"    PyStatus status;\n"
"\n"
"    PyConfig config;\n"
"    PyConfig_InitPythonConfig(&config);\n"
"\n"
"    /* プログラム名を設定する。\n"
"       Python を暗黙に事前初期化する。 */\n"
"    status = PyConfig_SetString(&config, &config.program_name,\n"
"                                L\"/path/to/my_program\");\n"
"    if (PyStatus_Exception(status)) {\n"
"        goto exception;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    status = Py_InitializeFromConfig(&config);\n"
"    if (PyStatus_Exception(status)) {\n"
"        goto exception;\n"
"    }\n"
"    PyConfig_Clear(&config);\n"
"    return;\n"
"\n"
"exception:\n"
"    PyConfig_Clear(&config);\n"
"    Py_ExitStatusException(status);\n"
"}"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1399
msgid ""
"More complete example modifying the default configuration, read the "
"configuration, and then override some parameters. Note that since 3.11, many "
"parameters are not calculated until initialization, and so values cannot be "
"read from the configuration structure. Any values set before initialize is "
"called will be left unchanged by initialization::"
msgstr ""
"デフォルトの設定を変更してから設定を読み込み、さらに一部のパラメーターを上書"
"きする、より完全な例です。\n"
"3.11 以降、多くのパラメーターは初期化するまで計算されないため、設定構造体から"
"値を読み取れないことに注意してください。\n"
"初期化関数の呼び出し前に設定された値は、初期化によって変更されません。 ::"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1406
msgid ""
"PyStatus init_python(const char *program_name)\n"
"{\n"
"    PyStatus status;\n"
"\n"
"    PyConfig config;\n"
"    PyConfig_InitPythonConfig(&config);\n"
"\n"
"    /* Set the program name before reading the configuration\n"
"       (decode byte string from the locale encoding).\n"
"\n"
"       Implicitly preinitialize Python. */\n"
"    status = PyConfig_SetBytesString(&config, &config.program_name,\n"
"                                     program_name);\n"
"    if (PyStatus_Exception(status)) {\n"
"        goto done;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    /* Read all configuration at once */\n"
"    status = PyConfig_Read(&config);\n"
"    if (PyStatus_Exception(status)) {\n"
"        goto done;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    /* Specify sys.path explicitly */\n"
"    /* If you want to modify the default set of paths, finish\n"
"       initialization first and then use PySys_GetObject(\"path\") */\n"
"    config.module_search_paths_set = 1;\n"
"    status = PyWideStringList_Append(&config.module_search_paths,\n"
"                                     L\"/path/to/stdlib\");\n"
"    if (PyStatus_Exception(status)) {\n"
"        goto done;\n"
"    }\n"
"    status = PyWideStringList_Append(&config.module_search_paths,\n"
"                                     L\"/path/to/more/modules\");\n"
"    if (PyStatus_Exception(status)) {\n"
"        goto done;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    /* Override executable computed by PyConfig_Read() */\n"
"    status = PyConfig_SetString(&config, &config.executable,\n"
"                                L\"/path/to/my_executable\");\n"
"    if (PyStatus_Exception(status)) {\n"
"        goto done;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    status = Py_InitializeFromConfig(&config);\n"
"\n"
"done:\n"
"    PyConfig_Clear(&config);\n"
"    return status;\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1462
msgid "Isolated Configuration"
msgstr "隔離設定"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1464
msgid ""
":c:func:`PyPreConfig_InitIsolatedConfig` "
"and :c:func:`PyConfig_InitIsolatedConfig` functions create a configuration "
"to isolate Python from the system. For example, to embed Python into an "
"application."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyPreConfig_InitIsolatedConfig` "
"と :c:func:`PyConfig_InitIsolatedConfig` は、Python をシステムから隔離する設"
"定を作成します。\n"
"例えば、Python をアプリケーションに組み込むために使います。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1469
msgid ""
"This configuration ignores global configuration variables, environment "
"variables, command line arguments (:c:member:`PyConfig.argv` is not parsed) "
"and user site directory. The C standard streams (ex: ``stdout``) and the "
"LC_CTYPE locale are left unchanged. Signal handlers are not installed."
msgstr ""
"この設定は、グローバルな設定変数、環境変数、コマンドライン引数、ユーザーのサ"
"イトディレクトリを無視します (:c:member:`PyConfig.argv` は解析しません)。\n"
"``stdout`` などの C の標準ストリームと LC_CTYPE ロケールは変更しません。\n"
"シグナルハンドラーも登録しません。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1474
msgid ""
"Configuration files are still used with this configuration to determine "
"paths that are unspecified. Ensure :c:member:`PyConfig.home` is specified to "
"avoid computing the default path configuration."
msgstr ""
"この設定でも、指定されていないパスを決めるために設定ファイルを使います。\n"
"デフォルトのパス設定の計算を避けるには、:c:member:`PyConfig.home` を必ず指定"
"してください。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1482
msgid "Python Configuration"
msgstr "Python 設定"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1484
msgid ""
":c:func:`PyPreConfig_InitPythonConfig` "
"and :c:func:`PyConfig_InitPythonConfig` functions create a configuration to "
"build a customized Python which behaves as the regular Python."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyPreConfig_InitPythonConfig` "
"と :c:func:`PyConfig_InitPythonConfig` は、通常の Python と同じように動作す"
"る、カスタマイズされた Python を作るための設定を作成します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1488
msgid ""
"Environments variables and command line arguments are used to configure "
"Python, whereas global configuration variables are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Python の設定には環境変数とコマンドライン引数を使いますが、グローバルな設定変"
"数は無視します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:1491
msgid ""
"This function enables C locale coercion (:pep:`538`) and :ref:`Python UTF-8 "
"Mode <utf8-mode>` (:pep:`540`) depending on the LC_CTYPE "
"locale, :envvar:`PYTHONUTF8` and :envvar:`PYTHONCOERCECLOCALE` environment "
"variables."
